      "id": "tool-lucky-draw",
      "title": "럭키드로우",
      "subcategory": "lucky_draw",
      "audience": [
        "teacher"
      ],
      "groupType": "whole_class",
      "estimatedMinutes": 5,
      "tags": [
        "랜덤",
        "뽑기",
        "전체활동"
      ],
      "description": "목록에서 무작위로 뽑아요. 뽑힌 항목 빼기, 여러 개 한 번에 뽑기가 돼요.",
      "howToUse": "번호나 별명을 한 줄에 하나씩 적고 [뽑기!]를 누르세요. 전자칠판에 띄우면 크게 보여요.",
      "promptRecipe": "교실용 랜덤 뽑기 도구를 만들어 줘. 목록은 한 줄에 하나, 뽑힌 항목 제외 옵션, 여러 개 뽑기, 결과를 크게 보여 주는 애니메이션. 외부 통신과 저장소는 쓰지 마.",
      "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>럭키드로우</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 16px; background: #f4f7fb; color: #1f2328; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.4rem; }\n  textarea { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 120px; font-size: 1rem; padding: 8px; }\n  .row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin: 8px 0; }\n  button { font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; border: 0; background: #3a5a78; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n  button.sub { background: #dde5ee; color: #1f2328; }\n  #stage { margin: 16px 0; min-height: 30vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 12vw, 6rem); font-weight: 800; text-align: center; }\n  #stage.spin { color: #8a94a0; }\n  #log { color: #5b636b; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<h1>🎲 럭키드로우</h1>\n<p>한 줄에 하나씩 적어요. 학생 번호나 별명을 쓰면 개인정보 걱정이 없어요.</p>\n<textarea id=\"list\" aria-label=\"뽑기 목록\">1번\n2번\n3번\n4번\n5번\n6번</textarea>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remove\" checked> 뽑힌 항목은 빼기</label>\n  <label>한 번에 <input type=\"number\" id=\"count\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" value=\"1\" style=\"width:4em\"> 개</label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <button id=\"draw\">뽑기!</button>\n  <button class=\"sub\" id=\"reset\">처음부터</button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"stage\" aria-live=\"polite\">?</div>\n<p id=\"log\"></p>\n<script>\n  const listEl = document.getElementById('list');\n  const stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n  const log = document.getElementById('log');\n  let pool = null; const picked = [];\n  const items = () => listEl.value.split('\\n').map((s) => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);\n  const rand = (n) => crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0] % n;\n  document.getElementById('reset').onclick = () => { pool = null; picked.length = 0; stage.textContent = '?'; log.textContent = ''; };\n  document.getElementById('draw').onclick = () => {\n    if (!pool || !document.getElementById('remove').checked) pool = items().filter((x) => !(document.getElementById('remove').checked && picked.includes(x)));\n    if (!pool.length) { stage.textContent = '다 뽑았어요!'; return; }\n    const n = Math.min(pool.length, Math.max(1, +document.getElementById('count').value || 1));\n    stage.classList.add('spin');\n    let t = 0;\n    const iv = setInterval(() => { stage.textContent = pool[rand(pool.length)]; if (++t > 15) finish(); }, 60);\n    function finish() {\n      clearInterval(iv);\n      stage.classList.remove('spin');\n      const result = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        const k = rand(pool.length);\n        result.push(pool[k]);\n        if (document.getElementById('remove').checked) pool.splice(k, 1);\n      }\n      picked.push(...result);\n      stage.textContent = result.join(', ');\n      log.textContent = '지금까지: ' + picked.join(', ');\n    }\n  };\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "tailprint": {
